2026-09-17T16:37:18.8906794Z API lifecycle bypass regressions
2026-09-17T16:37:18.8908433Z   VPS nested mutations
2026-09-17T16:37:34.6684060Z     blocks suspended users from changing features, mounts, and maintenance windows
2026-09-17T16:37:41.4962009Z     blocks suspended users from creating, showing, deleting, or using console tokens
2026-09-17T16:37:41.4962769Z   Operational per-VPS records
2026-09-17T16:37:48.3709031Z     blocks suspended users from managing OOM report rules
2026-09-17T16:37:59.8043176Z     blocks suspended users and suspended VPSes from user-data mutations and deploys
2026-09-17T16:38:06.7242945Z     blocks suspended users from creating, updating, or deleting host IP addresses
2026-09-17T16:38:06.7244061Z   User-owned control plane records
2026-09-17T16:38:09.2207958Z     blocks suspended users from deleting snapshot downloads
2026-09-17T16:38:20.5172113Z     blocks suspended users from mutating SSH keys and mail recipients
2026-09-17T16:38:34.1106868Z     blocks suspended users from managing namespace maps and entries
2026-09-17T16:38:43.2460914Z     blocks suspended users from reading or managing DNS TSIG secrets
2026-09-17T16:38:43.2463205Z     with a DNS record owned by a suspended user
2026-09-17T16:38:49.6708818Z       allows an authenticated administrator to update the record
2026-09-17T16:38:55.1955149Z       blocks the authenticated owner from updating the record
2026-09-17T16:38:55.1955775Z   VPS owner operations
2026-09-17T16:38:57.6647476Z     blocks suspended users from deleting suspended VPSes
2026-09-17T16:39:02.2752767Z     blocks active users from cloning or swapping suspended VPSes
2026-09-17T16:39:09.1888425Z     blocks suspended users from queuing VPS access/control mutations
2026-09-17T16:39:09.1889156Z   Dataset and snapshot mutations
2026-09-17T16:39:23.0401750Z     blocks active users from exporting deleted datasets or mutating deleted exports
2026-09-17T16:39:27.7176701Z     blocks suspended users from changing dataset plans
2026-09-17T16:39:34.6807523Z     blocks suspended users from creating, deleting, or rolling back snapshots
2026-09-17T16:39:43.8659394Z     blocks suspended users from mutating datasets
